<title>USA: Perez Companc SA issues $300 mln 144A debt.</title>
<headline>Perez Companc SA issues $300 mln 144A debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following high-yield debt issue from Argentine oil and gas company Perez Companc SA was priced in the 144A private placement market late on Thursday, according to a high-yield market source.</p>
<p>The deal was increased in size by $100 million and completed at the tight side of price talk from earlier in the session.</p>
<p>Morgan Stanley &amp; Co was lead manager on the deal.</p>
<p>BORROWER PEREZ COMPANC SA</p>
<p>AMT $300 MLN	 COUPON 9.00 PCT   MATURITY 1/30/2004</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 7/30/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B1    YIELD 9.00 PCT    PAY FREQ SEMI</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BB-MINUS  SPREAD 252 BP     CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1672</p>
</text>
